    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "<color=#FFD15A>AMA\xC7</color>\nXP ta\u015Flar\u0131n\u0131 topla, seviye atla,\nher seviyede bir y\xFCkseltme se\xE7.\nHer dakika bir BOSS gelir: yen ve\nd\xFC\u015F\xFCrd\xFC\u011F\xFC sand\u0131\u011F\u0131 al.\n8:00'de gelen SON BOSS'u yenersen\noyunu kazan\u0131rs\u0131n.\n\n<color=#FFD15A>\u0130PU\xC7LARI</color>\nAlt\u0131n d\xFC\u015Fmanlar = elit, daha \xE7ok \xF6d\xFCl.\nAlt\u0131nla D\xFCkkan'dan kal\u0131c\u0131 g\xFC\xE7 al.\n\u0130ki y\xFCkseltmeyi doldur: EVR\u0130M!"
